active_buckets:
  content: agent-file-handoff/Content
  improvement: agent-file-handoff/Improvement
  authority: Live directory listings define pending intake; no intake-index file.
  completion: Placeholder-only after byte-exact durable custody, applied guidance and report-level proof of use; record any blocker or explicit keep-active exception.

intake_protocol:
  - Inventory every report by original name, bytes, SHA-256, assignment and access limits; inspect all active files.
  - Separate owner facts, inspected local evidence, verified external facts, hypotheses and recommendations.
  - Use important findings in the owning UAI guidance immediately; a summary or index alone does not complete intake.
  - Correct contradictions before promotion. Reports cannot invent model qualification, schemas, hardware, topology, independent reviewers or local measurements.
  - Record each disposition, reason, applied memory paths and smallest test/defer route in the ledger and decision index.
  - Preserve full raw report bytes, including embedded images and mistakes, under the configured report-intake path with a manifest; after proof of use, remove the processed active copy.
  - Verify all raw hashes/lengths, report coverage, links, pointer checksums, memory size, secret hygiene and placeholder-only buckets.
  - Keep historical receipts immutable; current startup routing must lead to reviewed current state.
  - Commit and push the coherent verified memory change. Memory checks do not establish product readiness.

current_intake:
  date: 2026-09-19
  reports: 16
  raw_authority: docs/report-intake/2026-09-19/working-product-research
  manifest: docs/report-intake/2026-09-19/working-product-research/MANIFEST.md
  disposition: Useful corrected guidance applied throughout current UAI; unmeasured experiments deferred with explicit routes; unsupported claims rejected.
  prior_batch: The 47 reports of August 26/27 remain preserved historical evidence in their existing manifests and August 28 decision index.
  boundary: No model execution, numerical parity, quality, live seed, deployment, external memory operation or campaign progress is claimed.
